        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the character to the Torii gate while avoiding disruptions by matching colors with the cursor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you match colors, the puzzle rises and characters will move upward toward the torii.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you match colors while the puzzle is rising, it rises again in succession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more it rises, the more your excitement rises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action-puzzle game that blends color-matching with your cursor, obstacle avoidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matching colors and consecutively raising puzzles is the key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With three difficulty levels to choose from, players of all skill levels can enjoy the game—even those who aren’t comfortable with fast-paced controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Stage Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore the chakra disturbed by the Demon King and guide everyone on the map to a safe torii.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also special gimmicks on the map that you can solve using the characters you’ve unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a total of 30 stages, it should take about 1–2 hours to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Endless Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a mode where you compete to reach the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocks appear as obstacles and can be cleared by connecting four or more brown chakra panels to make them explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will be unlocked when you get a ticket in Stage Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Time Attack Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a mode where you compete for the fastest clear time across all stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will be unlocked when you clear Stage Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Versus Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a mode where you compete to reach the torii first while hindering your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Stage Mode, unlocking characters with hindering skills allows you to use those characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Important Notice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains colorful flashing panel elements and frequently moving visual effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individuals with photosensitive epilepsy or a history of seizures induced by visual stimuli should play with caution or avoid playing altogether.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Finally</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback is always welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the character to the Torii gate while avoiding disruptions by matching colors with the cursor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you match colors, the puzzle rises and characters will move upward toward the torii.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you match colors while the puzzle is rising, it rises again in succession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more it rises, the more your excitement rises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action-puzzle game that blends color-matching with your cursor, obstacle avoidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matching colors and consecutively raising puzzles is the key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With three difficulty levels to choose from, players of all skill levels can enjoy the game—even those who aren’t comfortable with fast-paced controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Stage Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore the chakra disturbed by the Demon King and guide everyone on the map to a safe torii.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also special gimmicks on the map that you can solve using the characters you’ve unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a total of 30 stages, it should take about 1–2 hours to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Endless Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a mode where you compete to reach the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocks appear as obstacles and can be cleared by connecting four or more brown chakra panels to make them explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will be unlocked when you get a ticket in Stage Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Time Attack Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a mode where you compete for the fastest clear time across all stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will be unlocked when you clear Stage Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Versus Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a mode where you compete to reach the torii first while hindering your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Stage Mode, unlocking characters with hindering skills allows you to use those characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Important Notice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains colorful flashing panel elements and frequently moving visual effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individuals with photosensitive epilepsy or a history of seizures induced by visual stimuli should play with caution or avoid playing altogether.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Finally</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback is always welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
